      "content": "To create an effective survey, you'll want to focus on questions that assess cultural immersion, neighborhood influence, and community-level factors. Consider questions like: \"How often do you participate in neighborhood events or activities?\" or \"Have you ever witnessed gang-related violence in your community?\" Additionally, you can also explore questions on social support networks, such as \"How often do you talk to a family member about your daily experiences?\" or \"Do your friends live in the same neighborhood?\" These types of questions can help identify patterns and behaviors that are unique to high-risk, inner-city urban environments.",
